  "html": "<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col col-8\"><h2>Thermoplastic Staker / Laminator</h2><figure><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-TP-Staker-Lam-b.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><div class=\"center\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n<li>Rolling tacker joins material every 3” (76 mm) Ultrasonic cutting of edge trim</li>\n<li>Ultrasonic cutting of edge trim</li>\n<li>12” (305 mm) and 4” (102 mm) wide material heads</li>\n<li>Handles 0°, +/- 45°, and 90° materials</li>\n<li>18 ft/min (5.5 m/min) material laydown</li>\n<li>Pad-ups and drop-offs +/-0.020” (+/-0.5 mm) tolerance</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"col col-4\">\n\t\t\t<nav class=\"side-nav\"><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Automated Tape Laying</h3><ul><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/automated-tape-laminator/\">Automated Tape Laminator</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/ply-by-ply-tape-laminator/\">Ply-by-Ply Tape Laminator</a></li><li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/tp-staker-laminator/\">Thermoplastic Staker / Laminator</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/electron-beam-tape-laminator/\">Electron Beam Tape Laminator</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/insitu-thermoplastic-laminator-i/\">Insitu Thermoplastic Laminator I</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/insitu-thermoplastic-laminator-ii/\">Insitu Thermoplastic Laminator II</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/lab-scale-atl-machine/\">Lab-Scale ATL Machine</a></li></ul></nav>\n</div></div><h3>Machine Images</h3><div class=\"gallery\"><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-TP-Staker-Lam-b.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-TP-Staker-Lam-b-300x237.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"237\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-TP-Staker-Lam-a.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-TP-Staker-Lam-a-300x251.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"